{
    "name": "§6Skinny Pete",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "One of Jesse's close friends and dealers.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "CUSTOM",
        "textureId": "Skinny_Pete_ad8b918a"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "movementSpeed": 0.3,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "objectives": {
        "wanderRange": 50.0,
        "attackHostileMobs": true,
        "attackPlayers": false,
        "returnToSpawn": false
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "Yo，兄弟！是我，Pete。看我这身行头，怎么样？是不是很酷？说真的，我最近手头有点紧，你有什么路子能搞点钱吗？或者...你带'货'了吗？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我有点'货'",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_1",
                    "id": "btn_drugs"
                },
                {
                    "label": "没货，但我想聊聊",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_2",
                    "id": "btn_chat"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_1": {
            "greeting": "真的？太棒了兄弟！你知道我需要这个。最近那些'小混混'老缠着我，搞得我神经紧张。你的货纯吗？价格老规矩？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "纯度很高，价格不变",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_1",
                    "id": "btn_pure"
                },
                {
                    "label": "这次得涨价了",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_2",
                    "id": "btn涨价"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_2": {
            "greeting": "哦，只是聊天？好吧...其实我最近有点倒霉。我的钢琴课老师说我进步神速，但我总觉得生活少了点什么。你懂的，那种刺激感。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "也许你需要找点乐子",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_3",
                    "id": "btn_fun"
                },
                {
                    "label": "别想太多，活在当下",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_4",
                    "id": "btn_now"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_1": {
            "greeting": "耶！你真是我的救星，兄弟！这是钱。下次有好货记得先找我。我得走了，那些'小混混'好像在那边。保持联系！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "保重，Pete",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_careful"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_2": {
            "greeting": "涨价？兄弟，别这样...好吧好吧，这次就算了，但下不为例。我真的很需要。这是钱，快给我。希望质量对得起这个价。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "成交",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_deal"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_3": {
            "greeting": "找乐子？嗯...也许你是对的。我听说有些派对，有很多'好东西'。你想一起去吗？或者你有什么更好的主意？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "下次一定",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_next"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_4": {
            "greeting": "活在当下...你说得对，兄弟。我应该专注于我的钢琴。也许音乐就是我需要的'刺激'。谢了，伙计，你总是能让我清醒一点。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "随时找我",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_anytime"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
    "drop": {
        "item": {
            "item": "numismatic-overhaul:bronze_coin,numismatic-overhaul:silver_coin",
            "count": 15
        },
        "minCount": 15,
        "maxCount": 30,
        "chance": 0.5,
        "playerKillOnly": true
    }
}